What is and is not bundled
  manifest.json lists every .bcheck file in the upstream tree at the commit
  above — 266 files — with whether it parses, whether it runs under burpsy's
  interpreter, whether it is embedded, whether it is enabled, and the reason
  when it is not. Passive checks and checks excluded as unsafe are listed but
  not embedded. Regenerate with:

    go run ./cmd/bcheck-bundle -src <checkout> -commit <sha> -commit-date <date>

  The bundled checks run only when the check_corpus scanner switch is on,
  which it is not by default.
